WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.780
I've chased down every question

2
00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:18.960
Read the books and followed every thread

3
00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:25.080
But standing at the edge of all I know

4
00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.740
I feel a deeper hunger in me

5
00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:33.680
There's a thirst that won't be satisfied

6
00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:37.340
By everything the world has shown

7
00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:40.660
We gather pearls of wisdom as we go

8
00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:46.840
But the deepest truths remain unknown

9
00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:50.400
We learn from what our senses tell us

10
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:53.200
We trust the ones who came before

11
00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:56.900
We reason through the darkness for a light

12
00:00:57.860 --> 00:01:01.380
But something's calling out for more

13
00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:06.540
Human minds have built cathedrals

14
00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:09.640
Mapped the stars and split the atom wide

15
00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:12.800
But when I ask "Why am I here?"

16
00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:13.360
The world has never satisfied

17
00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:19.060
Ever learning, never landing

18
00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:22.620
On the ground where certainty begins

19
00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:25.800
I've found the limits of my reach —

20
00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:28.080
Now I'm ready to look within

21
00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:32.440
Faith and learning, companions in the same cause

22
00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:35.300
Walking toward the light that never dims

23
00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:39.740
What the mind begins to question

24
00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:42.600
The spirit can complete

25
00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:46.400
Truth is knowable — God is not silent

26
00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:50.680
He's waiting at the edge of all we seek

27
00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:57.040
How did all of this begin?

28
00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:00.400
Is there purpose in the change?

29
00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:04.440
Is someone guiding, watching, reaching down

30
00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:07.160
To meet me where I am?

31
00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:10.660
I won't cling to fear of answers

32
00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:13.780
I won't hide behind my doubt

33
00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:17.560
Great wisdom leads to peace, I'm told

34
00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:20.320
And I'm ready to find out

35
00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:24.260
Faith and learning, companions in the same cause

36
00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:27.160
Walking toward the light that never dims

37
00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:31.640
What the mind begins to question

38
00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:34.460
The spirit can complete

39
00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:38.320
Truth is knowable — God is not silent

40
00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:42.540
He's waiting at the edge of all we seek

41
00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:50.420
I am more than flesh and reasoning

42
00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:53.440
There's a spirit living here inside

43
00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:57.720
When I reached beyond what I could prove

44
00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:00.820
That's when God became real to me

45
00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:03.620
The questions didn't disappear

46
00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:07.240
But fear gave way to hope

47
00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:11.060
In the stillness something spoke to me:

48
00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:15.120
"You were never searching alone"

49
00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:20.680
This is when God becomes real —

50
00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:28.540
Not a theory, but a voice you feel

51
00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:35.700
Faith and learning, companions in the same cause

52
00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:38.520
Walking toward the light that never dims

53
00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:43.000
What the mind begins to question

54
00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:45.800
The spirit can complete

55
00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:49.640
Truth is knowable — God is not silent

56
00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:53.880
He's waiting at the edge of all we seek

57
00:03:56.960 --> 00:04:00.580
So if you're standing where I stood

58
00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:04.120
Hungry, searching, wondering if it's real

59
00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:07.700
Ask Him — just speak what's in your heart

60
00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:10.080
He has answered me

61
00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:13.480
He will answer you

62
00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:19.080
Truth is knowable

63
00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:22.200
Peace can be found

64
00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:25.620
This I promise

65
00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:33.520
In the name of Jesus Christ

66
00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:38.240
Amen.
